    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Telemedicine services can help deliver healthcare services to patients living in remote areas of Afghanistan, Pakistan, Tajikistan and the Kyrgyz Republic in a timelier and more cost-effective manner, according to the findings of a  new study  conducted by researchers at Aga Khan University.",
